Label levels 0 to 9
Hardest to easiest by centrality
Stabilize dynamic-set difficulty" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="-8" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="Sample 5,000 Source Pages
Draw 500 pages from every bin
Balance all difficulty levels
Resample for each dynamic set" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="-8" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="Select a Reference Section
Split each article into sections
Randomly choose one section
Keep the source hidden at inference" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="-8" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="Generate an Objective Question
Llama 3.1 70B reads the section
Make it specific and self-contained
Require no outside context" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="-8" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="Generate the Gold Answer Separately
Answer from the same reference
Separate question and answer stages
Reduce answer leakage into wording" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="368" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="Enforce QA Quality
Require a word or short phrase
Drop answers longer than ten words
Regenerate unanswerable questions" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="368" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="Form the Dynamic Test Set
